- **Search route:** source-first direct reads of known exact files, not corpus-wide retrieval. Mersearch stable worker instructions (`mersearch-stable-1.0`, `tools/search_archive_content.py`) inspected; no Mersearch query executed and no archive-wide novelty/priority claim made.

