      "text": "I'd like you to write a scientific paper presenting the 'Universal Indicatrix' approach to unification as a concept, and walk through the process of unifying gravity and quantum mechanics, showing each step. Conclude with a description of the process for unifying physics as a whole, a brief mention of the broader SAT.4DHH.UC programme, and note that full unification been tentatively completed by the researchers and its tentative results are available as an 'open source theory of everything'.",
